  description: "If you have 2 cards in your Pendulum Zone, apply this effect based
    on the difference between their current Pendulum Scales.\r\n\u25CF 0: Destroy
    2 Spells/Traps on the field.\r\n\u25CF 1 to 3: Add 1 Level 2, 3, or 4 Pendulum
    Monster from your Deck to your hand.\r\n\u25CF 4 to 6: Add 1 Level 5, 6, or 7
    Pendulum Monster from your Deck to your hand.\r\n\u25CF 7+: Return up to 2 cards
    from your Pendulum Zone to the hand, then you can Special Summon 1 Pendulum Monster
    from your hand.\r\nYou can only activate 1 \"Pendulum Scale\" per turn."
